WEBVTT

00:18.510 --> 00:19.870
"White Room" "Large Window" "Mayu"

00:20.580 --> 00:22.240
Ta... Tama?!

00:46.640 --> 00:48.139
<i>Taken and granted,</i>

00:48.140 --> 00:52.149
<i>ideals are repetitious
games that slip through</i>

00:52.150 --> 00:54.879
<i>My daily life is so shot with holes</i>

00:54.880 --> 00:57.749
<i>that I can barely stand</i>

00:57.750 --> 00:59.049
<i>Empty theories without conclusions</i>

00:59.050 --> 01:03.289
<i>Dance steps along invisible rules</i>

01:03.290 --> 01:08.299
<i>The final bell holding
together the crumbling day rings</i>

01:08.300 --> 01:12.769
<i>In the scene I imagine</i>

01:12.770 --> 01:15.399
<i>you're there</i>

01:15.400 --> 01:18.169
<i>with a smile</i>

01:18.170 --> 01:23.679
<i>No forgiveness? No desires?</i>

01:23.680 --> 01:27.120
<i>And still</i>

01:28.780 --> 01:31.949
<i>We cry "OPEN"</i>

01:31.950 --> 01:36.289
<i>A future to get back and a world to destroy</i>

01:36.290 --> 01:38.689
<i>A wish to open. GOT IT?</i>

01:38.690 --> 01:40.359
<i>Now cross</i>

01:40.360 --> 01:43.029
<i>I wish you don't cry</i>

01:43.030 --> 01:49.999
<i>The future of light and dark,
let's believe in the "future"</i>

01:50.000 --> 01:56.500
<i>so that they overlap to gain color again</i>

02:01.050 --> 02:02.319
Tama...

02:02.320 --> 02:03.549
Tama-<i>chan...</i>

02:03.550 --> 02:05.349
Why...?

02:05.350 --> 02:08.059
I see now...

02:08.060 --> 02:09.519
Tama...

02:09.520 --> 02:12.829
Thank goodness, you were okay...

02:12.830 --> 02:14.160
Tama!

02:17.900 --> 02:20.569
But... why is Tama-<i>chan</i> there?

02:20.570 --> 02:22.839
Well, that too, but...

02:22.840 --> 02:26.069
why is Urith a Selector?

02:26.070 --> 02:29.809
Isn't she supposed to fulfill your wish?!

02:29.810 --> 02:31.979
My wish is,

02:31.980 --> 02:34.979
to a certain extent, already fulfilled...

02:34.980 --> 02:36.549
But...

02:36.550 --> 02:38.689
Then why battle now?

02:38.690 --> 02:41.689
You know something, don't you?

02:41.690 --> 02:44.029
Even about Tama...

02:44.030 --> 02:47.059
Not at all...

02:47.060 --> 02:49.529
Really.

02:49.530 --> 02:51.499
That's just like her.

02:51.500 --> 02:53.700
Such tasteless play...

02:54.700 --> 02:57.769
Poor Tama.

02:57.770 --> 03:02.270
But it's scary! She'll be hurt again.

03:05.180 --> 03:07.419
I go first.

03:07.420 --> 03:09.080
Grow.

03:10.520 --> 03:13.019
Battle staaart!

03:13.020 --> 03:15.089
Please go easy, okay?

03:15.090 --> 03:17.089
Tama! Don't!

03:17.090 --> 03:20.089
Can you please not speak to her?

03:20.090 --> 03:23.359
Tama is my LRIG.

03:23.360 --> 03:25.030
Wish Crisis!

03:29.970 --> 03:32.309
Yaaargh! So strong!

03:32.310 --> 03:34.079
Seriously?! Is it happening?!
Finally happening?!

03:34.080 --> 03:35.879
My rival appears?!

03:35.880 --> 03:39.549
All righty! This is getting exciting!

03:39.550 --> 03:41.419
This isn't anything to be happy about...

03:41.420 --> 03:43.379
Chorizo In The Fantasy!

03:43.380 --> 03:45.589
Say the name of the move properly!

03:45.590 --> 03:47.750
Cloth Crash Flash!

03:50.630 --> 03:52.089
Yahoo!

03:52.090 --> 03:53.559
So strong!

03:53.560 --> 03:55.220
Seriously?!

03:56.100 --> 03:57.469
Owww!

03:57.470 --> 03:59.069
It's so one-sided...

03:59.070 --> 04:01.399
At this rate, Chiyori's going to lose.

04:01.400 --> 04:02.569
Tama...

04:02.570 --> 04:05.439
Stop... Tama!

04:05.440 --> 04:07.579
Ru...

04:07.580 --> 04:10.749
There's no need to listen to her.

04:10.750 --> 04:13.409
She threw you away.

04:13.410 --> 04:15.249
N-No! Ru was...!

04:15.250 --> 04:17.419
Get Bound.

04:17.420 --> 04:17.990
No...

04:17.991 --> 04:19.650
It... It's coming!

04:24.760 --> 04:27.460
It seems Tama is fine without you.

04:37.110 --> 04:40.440
Look at how vividly she's enjoying herself.

04:41.440 --> 04:44.679
Nothing changed about her
ever since she was your LRIG.

04:44.680 --> 04:46.379
Tama...

04:46.380 --> 04:48.219
Not me...

04:48.220 --> 04:50.550
Ru, you're...

04:51.890 --> 04:54.220
the only one for me.

05:02.560 --> 05:04.030
No...

05:04.900 --> 05:07.669
Tama... You're not having fun, are you?

05:07.670 --> 05:11.730
What?
Eldora, Grow! And now, Kozame!

05:22.050 --> 05:25.249
Ru... I'm sorry...

05:25.250 --> 05:27.090
Tama...

05:29.160 --> 05:31.759
Tama was a bad girl.

05:31.760 --> 05:34.999
That's why I went bye-bye from Ru, right?

05:35.000 --> 05:37.069
Baroque Defense.

05:37.070 --> 05:39.229
Sh... Shiira!

05:39.230 --> 05:40.699
Attack!

05:40.700 --> 05:41.839
Or, maybe not.

05:41.840 --> 05:44.009
Aw, c'mon, do it.

05:44.010 --> 05:48.170
That's not something you say
when they're prepped, y'know?

05:52.910 --> 05:54.919
This isn't fun...

05:54.920 --> 05:56.719
Why...?

05:56.720 --> 06:00.019
Battle was so fun before.

06:00.020 --> 06:02.919
It was fun doing it with Ru.

06:02.920 --> 06:05.359
It's not fun because I'm with Urith...?

06:05.360 --> 06:07.029
Salvage!

06:07.030 --> 06:08.520
N-No!

06:10.530 --> 06:15.969
Tama isn't... having fun battling?

06:15.970 --> 06:17.300
Tama...

06:20.640 --> 06:23.609
Sorry... I'm sorry...

06:23.610 --> 06:26.579
I'm sorry, Tama!

06:26.580 --> 06:32.049
When I was battling Iona-<i>san,</i>
I didn't think I could return.

06:32.050 --> 06:35.719
I thought I was going to become an LRIG.

06:35.720 --> 06:39.729
Tama, Yuzuki, Hitoe, and all the
other girls who turned into LRIGs...

06:39.730 --> 06:43.229
If everyone could be saved,
I thought that would be okay.

06:43.230 --> 06:46.469
But... that was wrong.

06:46.470 --> 06:47.739
Ruko...

06:47.740 --> 06:49.569
I was lonely.

06:49.570 --> 06:53.779
I was lonely without you, Tama.

06:53.780 --> 06:57.079
Tama was... lonely too...

06:57.080 --> 06:58.749
It's my fault.

06:58.750 --> 07:02.079
It's because I didn't talk
about my true feelings.

07:02.080 --> 07:05.589
It's because I made you worried, Tama.

07:05.590 --> 07:07.259
I'm sorry...

07:07.260 --> 07:09.759
I should have talked more to you, Tama.

07:09.760 --> 07:13.659
Talked so that you would understand!

07:13.660 --> 07:15.759
Because Tama, you're my...

07:15.760 --> 07:18.930
You're my precious friend!

07:23.140 --> 07:24.800
Ruko...

07:25.610 --> 07:27.100
Friend...

07:30.180 --> 07:31.180
Huh?

07:31.181 --> 07:33.879
And... what the heck are you crying for?

07:33.880 --> 07:37.219
Because! Tama and Ru were friends!

07:37.220 --> 07:40.389
Them now battling as enemies is so cliché!

07:40.390 --> 07:41.619
So cliché!

07:41.620 --> 07:45.329
Of course I'm gonna cry... I love clichés!

07:45.330 --> 07:48.399
I can get my satisfaction
just with clichés!

07:48.400 --> 07:52.729
I really don't think this is the
time to be saying things like that...

07:52.730 --> 07:54.299
What?

07:54.300 --> 07:55.300
Huh?

07:55.301 --> 07:58.539
With the next attack,
we're going to lose...

07:58.540 --> 08:00.030
Then...

08:01.810 --> 08:03.079
Ru...

08:03.080 --> 08:04.979
Tama...

08:04.980 --> 08:07.079
Such a horrible girl.

08:07.080 --> 08:11.149
Doing it with me, and yet
thinking of someone else...

08:11.150 --> 08:13.889
What a turn-off...

08:13.890 --> 08:15.419
Let's finish this!

08:15.420 --> 08:16.910
Arc Aura!

08:49.720 --> 08:51.220
Tama?

08:52.690 --> 08:54.250
Tama...

08:55.360 --> 08:57.059
Wait a minute!

08:57.060 --> 08:58.069
Wait!

08:58.070 --> 09:00.569
Give me back Tama!

09:00.570 --> 09:02.739
If you want her back...

09:02.740 --> 09:05.369
battle me.

09:05.370 --> 09:06.869
No!

09:06.870 --> 09:10.370
Ru, don't battle! Never!

09:13.550 --> 09:16.449
I can't wait for our battle.

09:16.450 --> 09:19.549
You too... Iona.

09:19.550 --> 09:22.220
See you again, scum...

09:27.430 --> 09:28.920
Tama!

09:33.100 --> 09:34.590
Ru...!

09:41.940 --> 09:44.479
Ruko... are you all right?

09:44.480 --> 09:46.279
Yup, I'm okay.

09:46.280 --> 09:51.249
I know Tama is okay now, and
that she feels the same way as me.

09:51.250 --> 09:55.020
Sorry I made both of
you worried, Hitoe, Yuzuki.

09:57.930 --> 10:00.929
What a nice turn of events!

10:00.930 --> 10:04.269
A torn friendship and a rival appears!

10:04.270 --> 10:06.669
Like, so exciting!

10:06.670 --> 10:07.799
Chiyori-<i>san</i>?

10:07.800 --> 10:09.269
Like, you're still here?

10:09.270 --> 10:11.439
Cool, and cool! So super!

10:11.440 --> 10:12.709
That aside...

10:12.710 --> 10:14.110
Hey, you!

10:15.280 --> 10:18.649
We told her at length not to battle...

10:18.650 --> 10:21.049
Don't you care about what's
going to happen to Chiyori?

10:21.050 --> 10:25.649
Now, now. I talked about
it in depth too, you know?

10:25.650 --> 10:27.049
I talked about it, but...

10:27.050 --> 10:29.889
Lets see...

10:29.890 --> 10:32.029
Here it is!

10:32.030 --> 10:33.159
Lookie!

10:33.160 --> 10:34.559
Huh?

10:34.560 --> 10:35.959
What's that?

10:35.960 --> 10:39.229
Chorizo De Ibéricoña The Second!

10:39.230 --> 10:39.800
Huh?

10:39.801 --> 10:43.539
Chorizo? As in the sausage?

10:43.540 --> 10:44.909
Boop-boop!

10:44.910 --> 10:47.839
It's Chiyori's name when I become an LRIG!

10:47.840 --> 10:48.879
Huh?!

10:48.880 --> 10:52.049
You see? She just became even more excited.

10:52.050 --> 10:55.479
But... you lost to me.

10:55.480 --> 10:57.489
And you lost to Urith...

10:57.490 --> 10:59.419
So you lost twice already?

10:59.420 --> 11:00.519
That isn't good!

11:00.520 --> 11:03.589
But, but, I already won three times!

11:03.590 --> 11:06.259
My wish could come true
at any moment, y'know?

11:06.260 --> 11:09.929
If you lose again, your
wish is going to be reversed!

11:09.930 --> 11:15.569
The heroine in the novel loses
twice too, but ends up beating her rival!

11:15.570 --> 11:21.009
And then before she knows
it, she's at White Garden...

11:21.010 --> 11:24.249
White... Garden?

11:24.250 --> 11:27.009
Yup! A hyper-dimensional white void!

11:27.010 --> 11:28.549
White?

11:28.550 --> 11:30.349
Could it be...

11:30.350 --> 11:34.919
that white room I was at
when I became an LRIG?

11:34.920 --> 11:38.189
Wait! Does a room appear in that novel?!

11:38.190 --> 11:41.959
Wha...?! I gave you a copy of the novel.

11:41.960 --> 11:43.899
Didn't you read it?

11:43.900 --> 11:47.860
Ah, um... Not really...

11:49.540 --> 11:51.530
What's this about?

11:55.540 --> 12:00.540
Chiyori-<i>san</i>? Do you mind
letting us read that novel?

12:01.920 --> 12:03.279
WIXOSS...

12:03.280 --> 12:07.249
<i>The Wings of Lament Mark
the Dreams of the Ruined Land...</i>

12:07.250 --> 12:09.950
"Futase Fumio"

12:07.790 --> 12:09.620
Futase Fumio...

12:10.760 --> 12:13.429
In a future not far from now,

12:13.430 --> 12:18.069
mysterious beings called "LRIG"
appear throughout the world.

12:18.070 --> 12:21.669
LRIGs connect themselves to
young girls with special powers

12:21.670 --> 12:25.569
and are able to make
their wishes come true.

12:25.570 --> 12:29.479
In order for the wish to come true,
they need to defeat other LRIGs

12:29.480 --> 12:33.749
and gather the WIXOSS factors from them.

12:33.750 --> 12:36.079
A young girl meets an LRIG

12:36.080 --> 12:39.819
and is drawn into the battle for wishes.

12:39.820 --> 12:43.819
This young girl, who won her battles,

12:43.820 --> 12:48.490
ends up in the time
labyrinth, White Garden.

12:51.270 --> 12:55.599
White Garden? This is the
white windowed room, right?

12:55.600 --> 13:00.269
The word "Selector" doesn't
appear, but this all sounds so similar...

13:00.270 --> 13:02.479
It's written to sound cool, but...

13:02.480 --> 13:06.849
Yessy! She finally appears!
The Dark Lord of Atonement, Cocoon!

13:06.850 --> 13:08.449
Gotcha!

13:08.450 --> 13:10.219
The ruler of White Garden!

13:10.220 --> 13:13.989
The almighty being that holds
dominion over all the WIXOSS battles!

13:13.990 --> 13:16.620
Is she like, a last boss?

13:18.230 --> 13:21.130
I can't believe it ends here...

13:22.400 --> 13:24.869
The suspense! Hurry with the next volume!

13:24.870 --> 13:26.299
Um...

13:26.300 --> 13:27.329
Cocoon...?

13:27.330 --> 13:28.839
Hm?

13:28.840 --> 13:30.839
Isn't that English for "<i>mayu</i>"?

13:30.840 --> 13:31.470
Ah...

13:31.470 --> 13:32.470
Mayu!

13:32.471 --> 13:34.909
White room... Mayu...

13:34.910 --> 13:36.339
That's...

13:36.340 --> 13:37.970
That's it!

13:40.150 --> 13:41.980
She must know something!

13:43.750 --> 13:45.549
Futase Fumio...

13:45.550 --> 13:48.819
It says here that she originally
announced her novel over the Internet.

13:48.820 --> 13:52.759
What she wrote as a pastime caught the
attention of a person working at a publisher.

13:52.760 --> 13:54.429
The first book was published, and...

13:54.430 --> 13:57.599
she wrote the second book,
but the series stopped there?

13:57.600 --> 13:59.230
Looks like it.

14:01.570 --> 14:03.839
Could she be a Selector?

14:03.840 --> 14:08.039
But... why would she
glamorize it in her works?

14:08.040 --> 14:11.579
Yeah. If she knows about the white room,

14:11.580 --> 14:15.919
she should know what would
happen if someone continued battling.

14:15.920 --> 14:17.689
I want to meet her.

14:17.690 --> 14:19.019
Huh?

14:19.020 --> 14:21.259
We could find out a lot
of things if we ask her.

14:21.260 --> 14:22.689
A lot, as in?

14:22.690 --> 14:25.229
About Mayu...

14:25.230 --> 14:26.959
and about Tama.

14:26.960 --> 14:31.560
Yuzuki, you said something about
how Tama could be a "special girl," right?

14:33.300 --> 14:38.909
Not all Eternal Girls are normal girls.

14:38.910 --> 14:45.209
Among them may be a special
girl who holds mysterious powers.

14:45.210 --> 14:49.119
Tama, not sure, but I feel like...

14:49.120 --> 14:53.219
there's a way to make
the LRIGs return to normal.

14:53.220 --> 14:55.389
That's what Tama said.

14:55.390 --> 14:57.759
I want to save Tama.

14:57.760 --> 14:59.459
I want to save everyone!

14:59.460 --> 15:02.099
Ah, come to think of
it, where's Chiyori-<i>san</i>?

15:02.100 --> 15:03.929
Yaaargh!
Huh?

15:03.930 --> 15:07.169
There. Six wins in a row for Grandma.

15:07.170 --> 15:10.599
Urrh... You're too strong...

15:10.600 --> 15:15.079
If you don't try harder,
you're not going to get any.

15:15.080 --> 15:18.309
Could you be the Sorcerer of Blood?!
The Danger Zone of WIXOSS!

15:18.310 --> 15:22.279
Queen of Innocent!

15:22.280 --> 15:24.079
Who knows?

15:24.080 --> 15:26.919
I'll tell you if you win, Chiyori-<i>chan.</i>

15:26.920 --> 15:27.989
Oh?

15:27.990 --> 15:30.619
How about you two join us?

15:30.620 --> 15:33.320
Uh... maybe later.

15:33.430 --> 15:34.759
"Ruko"

15:34.760 --> 15:36.429
Ah! See?

15:36.430 --> 15:38.499
Here's the novel's website.

15:38.500 --> 15:40.000
- "Futase Fumio"
- "Official Website"

15:38.930 --> 15:40.930
It's still active.

15:44.000 --> 15:45.939
"Futase Fumio-<i>sama...</i>

15:45.940 --> 15:48.809
Excuse us for our sudden e-mail.

15:48.810 --> 15:51.879
We read your novel, Sensei.

15:51.880 --> 15:53.349
We'll be very upfront.

15:53.350 --> 15:55.779
We're Selectors...

15:55.780 --> 16:00.889
Sensei, are you aware of Selectors?

16:00.890 --> 16:04.859
If so, please allow us an
opportunity to speak with you.

16:04.860 --> 16:08.959
Kominato Ruko. Uemura Hitoe."

16:08.960 --> 16:10.729
Does that sound okay?

16:10.730 --> 16:12.170
Yup.

16:14.700 --> 16:16.639
See ya laters!

16:16.640 --> 16:19.069
We'll contact you when we get a reply!

16:19.070 --> 16:20.979
Be sure to come with us, okay?

16:20.980 --> 16:23.140
Absolutely!

16:30.680 --> 16:33.989
Will we... get a reply?

16:33.990 --> 16:37.019
There are a lot of things we don't know.

16:37.020 --> 16:41.429
Like how Akira-<i>san</i> and
Urith-<i>san</i> became Selectors again.

16:41.430 --> 16:43.260
Yup...

16:43.900 --> 16:47.569
It's no coincidence that Tama
became Urith's LRIG, right?

16:47.570 --> 16:49.230
Huh?

16:50.340 --> 16:54.009
Yuzuki... came to me, too.

16:54.010 --> 16:55.579
Mayu...

16:55.580 --> 16:57.709
Maybe it's her doing...

16:57.710 --> 17:00.079
Yup. It has to be.

17:00.080 --> 17:03.679
But, why? Why would she do such a thing?

17:03.680 --> 17:06.589
Right?! It just makes everyone confused!

17:06.590 --> 17:08.580
What are you saying?

17:12.390 --> 17:15.859
Why are you girls battling?

17:15.860 --> 17:19.229
All the while confused
by incomprehensible rules.

17:19.230 --> 17:22.239
You're all just being played by her.

17:22.240 --> 17:27.039
Selectors and LRIGs...
are all just dolls to her.

17:27.040 --> 17:30.879
All she's doing is playing with her dolls.

17:30.880 --> 17:32.549
Playing with dolls?

17:32.550 --> 17:37.579
She's enjoying seeing
the dolls battle each other.

17:37.580 --> 17:39.719
That's all there is to this...

17:39.720 --> 17:42.059
If that's true...

17:42.060 --> 17:44.250
I won't forgive her!

17:46.460 --> 17:47.629
I'll be going now.

17:47.630 --> 17:49.099
Okay.

17:49.100 --> 17:51.599
Um, you know...

17:51.600 --> 17:55.099
There was a lot that happened,

17:55.100 --> 17:58.469
but I'm happy you got to see Tama.

17:58.470 --> 18:03.409
Tama pairs up best next to you, Ruko.

18:03.410 --> 18:04.909
Yup.

18:04.910 --> 18:09.079
Let's do our best so that Tama-<i>chan</i>
can come back to you, Ruko.

18:09.080 --> 18:10.919
Hitoe...

18:10.920 --> 18:12.589
Yuzuki...

18:12.590 --> 18:14.250
Thanks.

18:15.420 --> 18:16.420
See you!

18:16.421 --> 18:18.420
Good night.
Good night.

18:23.000 --> 18:24.129
Disgusting...

18:24.130 --> 18:26.499
Huh?

18:26.500 --> 18:29.269
Those two are... unpleasant.

18:29.270 --> 18:30.439
Disgusting...

18:30.440 --> 18:31.930
What?

18:39.280 --> 18:41.870
Akira, it's Iona-<i>san.</i>

18:43.450 --> 18:45.889
How has Akira-<i>san</i> been?

18:45.890 --> 18:51.359
She calmed down quite a bit,
all because of you. Thank you.

18:51.360 --> 18:53.350
Not at all.

18:54.330 --> 18:55.959
Say, Akira?

18:55.960 --> 18:59.199
That girl... Please, come on in.

18:59.200 --> 19:00.690
Excuse me.

19:14.480 --> 19:17.219
Can you help me again?

19:17.220 --> 19:19.389
Yes...

19:19.390 --> 19:20.589
I will...

19:20.590 --> 19:22.250
I'll do anything...

19:24.830 --> 19:26.729
So cute...

19:26.730 --> 19:28.060
Akira...

19:43.510 --> 19:45.500
Truly disgusting...

19:47.380 --> 19:48.870
That smile...

19:57.860 --> 19:59.325
"Regarding Selectors"

19:59.326 --> 20:00.790
"Futase Fumio"

20:08.600 --> 20:11.709
This is Futase Fumio-<i>sensei</i>'s residence?

20:11.710 --> 20:14.109
That's what it said in the e-mail...

20:14.110 --> 20:15.739
I... I can't take this!

20:15.740 --> 20:18.049
Nervous! Nervous! Super nervous!

20:18.050 --> 20:21.719
So sorry here! She's surprisingly timid.

20:21.720 --> 20:25.910
Shuffle, shuffle, shuffle, shuffle!

20:35.260 --> 20:38.260
Hello... I sent an e-mail
yesterday. Kominato...

20:47.910 --> 20:49.740
H-Hello...

20:56.750 --> 20:59.150
Um, excuse me.

21:11.300 --> 21:13.100
Hello?

21:16.270 --> 21:18.339
What should we do?

21:18.340 --> 21:21.310
"White Room" "Large Window" "Mayu"

21:18.710 --> 21:20.469
White room...

21:20.470 --> 21:21.709
Mayu...

21:21.710 --> 21:23.879
Large window...

21:23.880 --> 21:25.309
White room...

21:25.310 --> 21:26.810
"Mayu"

21:25.850 --> 21:27.179
Mayu...

21:27.180 --> 21:29.719
Large window...

21:29.720 --> 21:31.519
White room...

21:31.520 --> 21:33.119
Hello...?
Mayu...

21:33.120 --> 21:36.450
Are you... Futase Fumio-<i>sensei</i>?
Large room...

21:39.790 --> 21:41.130
Yes...

21:47.500 --> 21:50.800
I'm... Futase Fumio.

21:52.540 --> 21:55.980
"Those Wild Delusions"

22:02.380 --> 22:03.979
<i>Life...</i>

22:03.980 --> 22:09.389
<i>A city of mazes with no exit</i>

22:09.390 --> 22:13.929
<i>and the sound of bells ringing</i>

22:13.930 --> 22:15.529
<i>I do...</i>

22:15.530 --> 22:21.099
<i>Leave the "now" handed to me</i>

22:21.100 --> 22:25.839
<i>as I begin to walk in the morning</i>

22:25.840 --> 22:31.279
<i>In a world where light and dark intersect</i>

22:31.280 --> 22:37.449
<i>catharsis begins to awake</i>

22:37.450 --> 22:42.589
<i>I swore in my shaking heart</i>

22:42.590 --> 22:50.590
<i>that I won't lose anyone anymore...!</i>

22:54.300 --> 22:59.409
<i>Even if my tears flow tomorrow</i>

22:59.410 --> 23:06.109
<i>I'll run through the wind</i>

23:06.110 --> 23:11.119
<i>Release myself towards
the future I selected</i>

23:11.120 --> 23:13.789
<i>to regain it</i>

23:13.790 --> 23:20.890
<i>I won't give up on my wish</i>

23:26.900 --> 23:30.599
don't you know more than
what's written in the novel?

23:30.600 --> 23:34.739
If you can defeat me in battle,
I'll tell you everything that I know.

23:34.740 --> 23:36.439
How much do you think she knows?

23:36.440 --> 23:38.679
What's with that form?

23:38.680 --> 23:41.000
"This Impatience Is an Awakening"

23:38.910 --> 23:40.980
This Impatience Is an Awakening.
